   "design": "Standard sections are generated from the publication database, the CV record and institutional templates, and the teacher checks them, instead of retyping publications and boilerplate. A budget template holds the institution's salary scales and rates. A funder template checks length and required parts. The research case, planning, correspondence, portal entry, sign-off and submission stay with the teacher. The research case is written by the teacher, and no proposal text is uploaded to tools that breach confidentiality.",
